<title>PORTUGAL: Finantia seeks cancellation of BFE sale.</title>
<headline>Finantia seeks cancellation of BFE sale.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Finantia has lodged a request in court asking for the cancellation of the privatisation of Banco de Fomento e Exterior (BFE), Banco Finantia said in a statement.</p>
</text>
